      "starting_point": "Same frozen inputs; all 200 boundary replicates, 2000 REML bootstrap replicates per water type, and 216 basin-cost scenarios.",
      "interpretation": "Extended downstream analysis completed, including 2000 REML replicates per waterbody and 216 basin-cost scenarios."
